<title>CANADA: RESEARCH ALERT - Source Services started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Source Services started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has started coverage of Source Services Corp with a rating of buy, a source at the brokerage said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Dallas temporary staffing company opened up 1/4 to 17-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
